18.0244 17.4187 18.0461 17.2246 17.918L17.1465 17.8535L12.7275 13.4346C11.5908 14.4094 10.1149 15 8.5 15C4.91015 15 2 12.0899 2 8.5C2 4.91015 4.91015 2 8.5 2ZM8.5 3C5.46243 3 3 5.46243 3 8.5C3 11.5376 5.46243 14 8.5 14C11.5376 14 14 11.5376 14 8.5C14 5.46243 11.5376 3 8.5 3Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a><button aria-label="Open menu" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-component="Button" data-variant="tertiary" class="f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-icon-only"><span class="f9ZZrG_icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.375 13.875C9.65099 13.8752 9.875 14.099 9.875 14.375C9.87497 14.651 9.65098 14.8748 9.375 14.875H3.95801C3.68203 14.8748 3.45804 14.651 3.45801 14.375C3.45801 14.099 3.68202 13.8752 3.95801 13.875H9.375ZM16.041 9.5C16.3172 9.5 16.541 9.72386 16.541 10C16.541 10.2761 16.3171 10.5 16.041 10.5H3.95801C3.68203 10.4998 3.45804 10.276 3.45801 10C3.45801 9.72397 3.68202 9.50018 3.95801 9.5H16.041ZM16.041 5.125C16.3172 5.125 16.541 5.34886 16.541 5.625C16.541 5.90111 16.3171 6.125 16.041 6.125H3.95801C3.68204 6.12482 3.45804 5.901 3.45801 5.625C3.45801 5.34897 3.68202 5.12518 3.95801 5.125H16.041Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main id="main-content"><article data-page-top-spacer="condensed" class="theme-slate theme-surface" data-nav-surface="slate-dark" data-page-surface="slate-dark"><span hidden="" data-site-header-theme="slate-dark"></span><section class="ZSMdoa_root" data-theme="ivory"><div class="pM-nba_container"><div class="pM-nba_root"><div class="pM-nba_titleSubhead"><h1 class="tOQyXa_headline-1" data-component="Headline">The Anthropic Institute</h1></div><div class="pM-nba_bodyCtas"><div class="pM-nba_body"><p class="tOQyXa_body-1--serif" data-component="Body"><strong>From inside a frontier AI lab, we confront the most significant challenges about how powerful AI will impact the world around us.</strong></p><p class="tOQyXa_body-1--serif" data-component="Body">The Anthropic Institute exists to understand and shape the consequences of powerful AI systems. The Institute focuses on four major research areas that will determine whether these systems deliver radical upsides in science, security, economic development, and human agency—or whether they will pose a range of unprecedented risks.</p></div><div class="pM-nba_ctaWrapper"><div class="pM-nba_buttonGroup"><a href="/research/anthropic-institute-agenda" class="f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-primary f9ZZrG_size-medium pM-nba_button">Our research agenda</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ZSMdoa_root" data-theme="ivory"><div class="wTN57W_container"><h2 class="text-caption-1-mono wTN57W_compactLabel">Problems we’re working on</h2><div class="wTN57W_compactRoot wTN57W_fourItems" style="--compact-columns:4;--compact-columns-tablet:2"><div class="wTN57W_compactItems"><div class="wTN57W_compactItem"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-6" data-component="Headline">AI, jobs, and the economy.</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 wTN57W_body" data-component="Body">How is AI reshaping jobs, inside Anthropic and elsewhere? And how do these impacts add up for economies around the world?</p></div><div class="wTN57W_compactItem"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-6" data-component="Headline">Threats and resilience.</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 wTN57W_body" data-component="Body">What opportunities for greater societal resilience will powerful AI give us, and how could misuse of AI threaten or fracture social cohesion?</p></div><div class="wTN57W_compactItem"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-6" data-component="Headline">How AI systems behave in the wild.</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 wTN57W_body" data-component="Body">What are the expressed “values” of advanced AI systems? How will societies shape their behavior, and how will they affect our own?</p></div><div class="wTN57W_compactItem"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-6" data-component="Headline">AI research and development</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 wTN57W_body" data-component="Body">If AI systems are being used to autonomously develop and improve themselves, how do humans stay in the loop, and how will these systems be governed?</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ZSMdoa_root theme-ivory theme-surface" data-theme="ivory" data-nav-surface="ivory-light"><div class="W1FydW_frame"><div class="W1FydW_root"><article class="W1FydW_featured"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Scenarios for our economic future" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_7lajinpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/research/team/economics">Economics</a></p><time>Sep 9, 2026</time></header><figure class="W1FydW_featuredFigure"><a class="W1FydW_media W1FydW_mediaLink" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/institute/econ-scenarios"><img alt="Scenarios for our economic future" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="W1FydW_mediaImage" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 384w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 640w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 750w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 828w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 2048w, https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 3840w" src="https://assets.claude.com/c156fa616617cb5148a76a7f731f4e26fce91797.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max"/></a></figure><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/institute/econ-scenarios"><h2 class="tOQyXa_headline-3 W1FydW_featuredTitle" data-component="Headline">Scenarios for our economic future</h2><p class="tOQyXa_body-3 W1FydW_featuredSummary" data-component="Body">Anthropic’s Economics team is sharing a new model of how AI may affect economic growth, jobs, wages, and more by 2030. The model lets you explore the scenarios, tell us what you think will happen, and see how your answers compare to +10,000 Americans.</p></a></article><div class="W1FydW_column W1FydW_left"><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Illuminating the frontier" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_ulejinpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/research/team/alignment">Alignment</a></p><time>Sep 17, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/institute/measuring-pace-of-ai-development"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Illuminating the frontier</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">Anthropic is sharing new measurements that would give the public visibility into frontier AI development.</p></a></article><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to When AI builds itself" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_umejinpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" rel="nofollow" href="/search?topic=alignment">Alignment</a></p><time>Jun 4, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_media W1FydW_mediaLink" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/institute/recursive-self-improvement"><img alt="When AI builds itself" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="900" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="W1FydW_mediaImage" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 256w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 384w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 640w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 750w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 828w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 2048w, https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 3840w" src="https://assets.claude.com/f075603c61497c892b0d487206067434899a1506.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max"/></a><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/institute/recursive-self-improvement"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">When AI builds itself</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">Our progress toward recursive self-improvement, and its implications.</p></a></article></div><div class="W1FydW_column W1FydW_right"><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to What 81,000 people want from AI" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_ulijinpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/research/team/economics">Economics</a></p><time>Mar 18, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_media W1FydW_mediaLink" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/features/81k-interviews"><img alt="What 81,000 people want from AI" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="W1FydW_mediaImage" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 256w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 384w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 640w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 750w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 828w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 2048w, https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 3840w" src="https://assets.claude.com/a06f990032e3315c580e85cf03bf5403caa26934.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max"/></a><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/features/81k-interviews"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">What 81,000 people want from AI</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">We invited Claude.ai users to share how they use AI, what they dream it could make possible, and what they fear it might do. Nearly 81,000 people participated—the largest and most multilingual qualitative study of its kind. Here&#x27;s what we found.</p></a></article><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Economic Index" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_umijinpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" rel="nofollow" href="/search?topic=economic-index">Economic Index</a></p><time>Jun 26, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/economic-index"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Economic Index</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">The Anthropic Economic Index reveals the shape of AI adoption across the world. Here, you can explore the data behind our research to understand how people are using Claude across every US state and hundreds of occupations.</p></a></article></div></div></div></section><section class="ZSMdoa_root" data-theme="ivory"><div><section class="_9T-FmG_container"><script>(function(){try{var p=new URLSearchParams(location.search);if(!["sort","view","group","category","team"].some(function(k){return p.has(k)})||document.getElementById("listing-pending"))return;var s=document.createElement('style');s.id="listing-pending";s.textContent="[data-listing-rows]{display:none!important}[data-listing-skeleton]{display:block!important}[data-listing-state]{visibility:hidden}";document.head.appendChild(s)}catch(e){}})();</script><div class="RUAb5W_container" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="RUAb5W_stats text-caption-1-mono"><div class="RUAb5W_stats-item"><p class="RUAb5W_stats-coun